stage: cfg (debug_assert fires inside Cfg::build)
panic: "catch handler must appear after all its try-region blocks in RPO"
site: src/decompile/cfg.rs:441:13
repro: cargo fuzz run fuzz_cfg fuzz/crashes/fuzz_cfg/515ce46d6dac

Surfaced by a 60s smoke re-run after the UnsupportedVersion fix
unblocked deep fuzz_cfg exploration.

Invariant 7 violation: an exception handler block ends up earlier in
RPO than one of the try-region blocks that lists it as its handler.
Adversarial input has overlapping/self-referential exception handler
ranges that the post-order fixup doesn't straighten out. Fix is to
switch from debug_assert to a typed Err (or replace the RPO fixup
with one that is invariant-preserving by construction).
